WEBVTT

00:03.540 --> 00:06.400
(Get ready, wake your psyche up, MOB!)

00:06.400 --> 00:09.210
(Get ready, dig your anger up, MOB!)

00:09.210 --> 00:12.060
(Get ready, wake your psyche up, MOB!)

00:12.060 --> 00:13.120
(Get ready!)

00:14.020 --> 00:18.710
Coming down, could you fill your satisfaction?

00:19.770 --> 00:24.450
You're a MOB. Can't you feel your own frustration?

00:25.480 --> 00:30.200
Coming down, could you fill your satisfaction?

00:31.220 --> 00:34.760
You're a MOB. What do you want to be?

00:34.760 --> 00:41.300
Wear your overflowing emotions on your sleeve and break it down.

00:42.520 --> 00:46.200
What do you see once you go beyond your limits?

00:46.200 --> 00:49.180
(99.9! 99.9!)

00:49.180 --> 00:52.060
The mysterious percentage.

00:53.740 --> 00:56.530
Cryin' my life, cryin' my psyche,

00:56.530 --> 00:59.480
cryin' my heart in such commonplaces!

00:59.480 --> 01:02.310
Is that your ideal? Is that your mind?

01:02.310 --> 01:05.220
It all begins when it hits 100.

01:05.220 --> 01:08.010
The MOB is alive. The MOB is high.

01:08.010 --> 01:10.900
The MOB is staying frustrated, aren't you?

01:10.900 --> 01:15.290
Is that your ideal? Is that your mind? Right now...

01:16.610 --> 01:17.830
Your life is your own.

01:17.830 --> 01:20.600
(Get ready, wake your psyche up, MOB!)

01:20.270 --> 01:25.110
Mob Psycho

01:20.600 --> 01:23.490
(Get ready, dig your anger up, MOB!)

01:23.490 --> 01:26.360
(Get ready, wake your psyche up, MOB!)

01:26.360 --> 01:27.670
(Get ready!)

01:29.980 --> 01:33.980
Boss Fight
~The Final Light~

01:36.940 --> 01:39.800
Now I'll be able to hit
you with everything...

01:39.800 --> 01:42.930
My powers... and my rage.

01:51.170 --> 01:52.630
Output 20%

01:57.470 --> 01:58.800
Is that it?

02:04.430 --> 02:06.820
This is finally getting interesting.

02:19.840 --> 02:20.990
You're...

02:21.740 --> 02:24.170
You're enjoying this too, aren't you?

02:27.490 --> 02:29.500
What the hell is going on?

02:29.920 --> 02:31.900
They're fighting in
a whole different stratosphere!

02:35.830 --> 02:40.550
As righteous as you try to sound,
deep down, you're the same as me.

02:44.640 --> 02:45.570
Nii-san!

02:46.420 --> 02:48.810
How does it feel to be released
from your shackles?

02:48.810 --> 02:51.520
We are freer than anyone else!

02:54.520 --> 02:55.370
Nii-san...

03:12.870 --> 03:15.840
How... How could I...

03:16.220 --> 03:17.830
How could I be so foolish?

03:18.850 --> 03:23.440
It may have only been for a moment,
but I let this power control me!

03:26.330 --> 03:28.310
You're so emotionally unstable.

03:28.480 --> 03:33.750
At this rate, you'll never catch up to me,
no matter how far you go.

03:33.750 --> 03:35.910
I am the best in the world!

03:36.860 --> 03:41.860
How did your life end up being so hollow?

03:42.670 --> 03:46.340
I can't judge you for the life
you chose, though.

03:46.840 --> 03:48.840
You were just unlucky.

03:50.320 --> 03:51.920
What are you talking about?

03:51.920 --> 03:56.340
There is no one in this world
that is as lucky as me!

03:56.340 --> 03:57.800
Output 50%

03:58.340 --> 04:00.510
Heaven bestowed these powers upon me

04:00.510 --> 04:06.200
and made you all extras,
created solely to make my star shine!

04:06.200 --> 04:10.060
Really? Then it wasn't luck
that you were lacking.

04:10.730 --> 04:11.580
It was bonds.

04:12.480 --> 04:13.730
What?

04:14.090 --> 04:17.690
You were the only one
who existed in your world.

04:18.190 --> 04:20.290
You lived in overwhelming solitude.

04:21.830 --> 04:23.180
I know that feeling well...

04:23.490 --> 04:26.470
Living in a world where I'm completely alone,
one I want to forget forever.

04:28.840 --> 04:30.600
I don't understand.

04:30.600 --> 04:31.610
Why?

04:31.610 --> 04:33.450
Why are you crying?

04:35.370 --> 04:38.210
You might not believe me,

04:38.570 --> 04:41.920
but I really don't want to hurt you.

05:04.550 --> 05:05.320
I'm sorry...

05:12.880 --> 05:15.090
What the hell is going on?

05:15.090 --> 05:16.710
Don't ask me.

05:17.010 --> 05:19.790
The president's aura is gone.

05:19.790 --> 05:22.270
Does that mean it's over?

05:22.940 --> 05:23.900
Yes!

05:24.240 --> 05:27.530
Impressive. Is that boy actually human?

05:27.530 --> 05:29.930
He's just a normal middle school kid.

05:30.270 --> 05:34.320
Nii-san... You used a tremendous
amount of power again.

05:34.880 --> 05:35.770
It's not over yet.

05:36.760 --> 05:39.200
My dad's aura didn't disappear.

05:39.790 --> 05:41.020
It changed.

05:43.820 --> 05:48.080
My dad mentioned before that
he picked up the habit of only awakening

05:48.080 --> 05:49.920
when put under a lot of stress.

06:22.110 --> 06:24.230
This goes beyond human understanding.

06:24.230 --> 06:27.700
How can one man's powers be so immense?

06:27.940 --> 06:32.160
Shigeo... This is the one day in your life
you shouldn't try to do the impossible.

06:32.540 --> 06:36.450
He's already using way more power
than he did when beat me.

06:37.350 --> 06:38.950
If you can't win, run.

06:39.580 --> 06:42.630
You're not responsible for any of this,

06:43.340 --> 06:44.080
Mob.

06:46.980 --> 06:48.970
I've never felt like this before.

06:50.850 --> 06:52.070
Wake up.

06:52.070 --> 06:55.310
Don't think I'm going to let you say
you're done already.

06:57.090 --> 06:59.040
Wake up!

06:59.040 --> 07:00.090
No.

07:01.010 --> 07:02.060
As much as I hate to admit it,

07:02.550 --> 07:04.450
I'm not strong enough.

07:04.900 --> 07:09.280
I don't have the power to show you a new path.

07:11.010 --> 07:15.710
You awakened my destructive impulses,
now you have to deal with them!

07:16.200 --> 07:19.170
Don't go hiding in your shell now!

07:26.370 --> 07:27.680
I give up.

07:28.300 --> 07:32.670
I hoped that you could turn over a new leaf
and become a better person,

07:33.320 --> 07:34.460
but that hope's gone now!

07:39.460 --> 07:42.660
I-It appears... that we're both...

07:42.660 --> 07:47.230
influencing each other quite a bit...

07:47.460 --> 07:51.560
Yes. But I couldn't be a good influence.

07:51.970 --> 07:54.450
I'm done. We can both lose at this point.

07:58.160 --> 07:59.620
Output 100%

07:59.620 --> 08:00.630
This is...

08:05.790 --> 08:07.710
I might actually die...

08:08.310 --> 08:09.050
Mob!

08:12.220 --> 08:13.010
Shigeo.

08:13.360 --> 08:14.110
Nii-san!

08:14.110 --> 08:14.840
Heya.

08:15.010 --> 08:16.300
Well done.

08:17.250 --> 08:18.640
No, this is nothing.

08:19.530 --> 08:21.500
Nothing compared to the fear
of losing all I have.

08:38.820 --> 08:42.710
Body improvement! Fight on!

09:12.090 --> 09:13.200
I'll defeat you!

09:22.660 --> 09:24.830
If something like that makes it outside...

09:27.410 --> 09:28.830
It'll explode...

09:32.350 --> 09:33.760
It'll explode?

09:34.090 --> 09:36.310
Oh, it'll explode!

09:37.620 --> 09:41.070
Run away! Everyone, run away!

09:41.070 --> 09:41.960
Mob!

09:41.960 --> 09:43.140
You're alive!

09:43.670 --> 09:46.800
He ended up releasing too much
energy and self-destructed!

09:46.800 --> 09:48.420
You're bleeding like crazy!

09:48.420 --> 09:50.650
Master, please run!

09:51.190 --> 09:53.480
All that's left is an
excessive amount of energy.

09:53.480 --> 09:55.540
I'm pretty sure an explosion will happen,

09:56.240 --> 09:58.110
a huge one at that!

09:59.750 --> 10:02.040
So you're saying we won't
be able to contain it.

10:02.040 --> 10:03.120
Let's hurry!

10:05.650 --> 10:06.480
Ritsu.

10:06.820 --> 10:09.600
Let's run. We're gonna get caught
up in that if we stay here.

10:11.100 --> 10:13.740
That's the president's final light...

10:13.740 --> 10:16.310
Our president who was trying
to take over the world...

10:16.310 --> 10:18.840
Just shut up and run! You're gonna die!

10:19.030 --> 10:21.500
Huh? Hey, where's Shigeo?

10:24.060 --> 10:26.340
You made the right choice.

10:26.340 --> 10:27.960
There's no way to avoid this.

10:27.960 --> 10:31.360
Your only choice is to end my life—
to sever the energy source—

10:31.360 --> 10:33.800
before the explosion happens.

10:35.870 --> 10:37.110
What are you doing?

10:37.110 --> 10:38.650
I'm going to contain the explosion.

10:39.970 --> 10:42.820
In the end, you aren't able to defeat me,

10:42.820 --> 10:47.790
save your friends, or save yourself.

10:47.790 --> 10:51.750
With your powers, you should've
been able to handle this better.

10:51.750 --> 10:55.000
Just having powers doesn't mean
everything works out for you.

10:55.300 --> 10:57.640
But that's perfectly fine,

10:58.870 --> 11:02.480
as long as you make
the important choices yourself.

11:03.280 --> 11:06.430
I'm the protagonist of my own life.

11:08.270 --> 11:10.440
That's why I chose to be here.

11:10.950 --> 11:15.390
No matter how much I dislike you,
to leave you to suffer on your own

11:15.390 --> 11:17.060
would just be too sad.

11:18.200 --> 11:20.130
So I'm going to help you.

11:23.250 --> 11:26.050
What do you plan to do with that filthy cat?

11:26.680 --> 11:30.520
Well, the poor thing was drenched
and shivering in the rain.

11:30.980 --> 11:32.120
And think about it...

11:32.620 --> 11:35.340
Sho will grow up into a gentle boy.

11:35.650 --> 11:38.300
He's going to grow up watching you, after all.

11:38.300 --> 11:40.980
We need to be gentle. Gentle.

11:41.800 --> 11:44.180
Why did you have to be so violent?!

11:44.560 --> 11:50.020
To lead an organization,
I need to establish my dominance.

11:50.020 --> 11:52.730
You can't move people's hearts
with psychic powers!

11:52.730 --> 11:55.360
No, power is absolute.

11:55.570 --> 11:59.320
As long as I have this power,
people will follow me.

11:59.590 --> 12:02.100
You think that's true for everyone?

12:02.100 --> 12:03.030
I do.

12:03.310 --> 12:06.450
Sho is also showing interest
in my powers as well.

12:06.450 --> 12:07.530
Goodbye.

12:13.080 --> 12:15.220
When did I...

12:20.170 --> 12:21.940
If I can absorb it...

12:21.940 --> 12:24.470
Don't. You'll just end up...

12:27.820 --> 12:29.780
You wanted to apologize, didn't you?!

12:30.480 --> 12:34.240
Then you need to say it loud and clear!

12:37.870 --> 12:41.010
That's right. I also...

12:41.780 --> 12:45.940
I also have someone I need
to express my feelings to!

13:08.900 --> 13:09.660
Mob...

13:11.430 --> 13:14.940
Mob Psycho

13:14.940 --> 13:16.440
Mob Psycho

13:20.100 --> 13:21.220
Nii-san!

13:21.220 --> 13:22.910
Hey, wake up!

13:23.250 --> 13:24.620
Kageyama-kun!

13:24.620 --> 13:25.450
Mob!

13:25.450 --> 13:26.570
Shigeo!

13:26.570 --> 13:27.680
Nii-san!

13:29.030 --> 13:30.490
He's regained consciousness.

13:31.070 --> 13:32.230
Let's dig him out.

13:36.050 --> 13:37.790
Thank goodness you're okay.

13:37.790 --> 13:39.360
Unbelievable.

13:40.070 --> 13:43.370
Anyway, we should get away from here.

13:43.370 --> 13:44.210
Can you walk?

13:44.750 --> 13:46.010
Yes...

13:46.010 --> 13:49.820
All of our wounds have been healed.
Our clothes are in shambles, though.

13:50.440 --> 13:51.430
You're right...

13:51.750 --> 13:54.530
Shigeo, what's up with
the left side of your chest?

13:55.660 --> 13:57.880
That's quite the bold fashion statement.

13:58.570 --> 14:02.540
Seriously... You never cease to amaze.

14:02.540 --> 14:04.570
I do consider you my rival, you know?

14:04.800 --> 14:07.140
Don't wander off too far.

14:13.650 --> 14:16.580
This ground... It's not concrete.

14:16.860 --> 14:18.800
My mind feels all spacey.

14:19.380 --> 14:20.960
The sky seems cramped.

14:21.430 --> 14:22.930
Where are we?

14:23.840 --> 14:26.600
There's the exit. Watch out for
things that may fall onto your head.

14:27.580 --> 14:29.010
It's quiet.

14:29.010 --> 14:31.930
Surprisingly, there aren't any
news helicopters flying around.

14:31.930 --> 14:33.380
Well, yeah.

14:33.380 --> 14:36.230
They're too scared to come here
when they know so little.

14:36.700 --> 14:38.770
Everything seems fine,
even after that giant explosion.

14:38.770 --> 14:39.980
What's going on?

14:40.560 --> 14:44.190
I seriously thought
you were a goner back there.

14:45.170 --> 14:48.570
I was sure ground zero
would've been eviscerated.

14:50.460 --> 14:51.790
The hell is that?

14:52.970 --> 14:55.370
But what appeared there happened to be...

14:55.910 --> 14:56.770
Hey!

14:57.240 --> 14:58.040
Nii-san!

14:58.220 --> 15:01.820
Are you okay?
Are you still actually hurt somewhere?

15:01.820 --> 15:05.500
Thanks, Ritsu. I think my body's okay.

15:05.860 --> 15:08.570
But lately, whenever I use a lot of power,

15:08.570 --> 15:11.070
I have a hard time staying awake afterward.

15:11.070 --> 15:11.870
Huh?

15:15.150 --> 15:16.890
I'll carry you partway,

15:17.180 --> 15:18.280
so you can rest.

15:19.850 --> 15:23.190
Carry him where? Our house is...

15:23.660 --> 15:28.500
Sorry, he'll fix up your house,
but he'll need three days.

15:28.500 --> 15:30.240
Just three days?!

15:31.840 --> 15:33.930
You guys wanna come to my place?

15:33.930 --> 15:36.370
It'll be a bit cramped,
but I'm sure we can make it work.

15:37.460 --> 15:40.250
At least try to hide your displeasure, jeez.

15:40.850 --> 15:42.420
Oh, don't worry about me.

15:45.320 --> 15:47.760
Could we stop by the school first?

15:48.240 --> 15:49.970
At this hour?

15:49.970 --> 15:52.580
There should be a spare
tracksuit in his club room.

15:52.930 --> 15:55.140
Telepathy Club

15:52.930 --> 15:55.140
Body Improvement Club

15:57.020 --> 15:58.060
That must be it.

15:59.340 --> 16:03.020
I wonder if I could borrow one for myself.

16:00.560 --> 16:04.520
Body improvement

16:00.560 --> 16:04.520
Lower body
strengthening month!!

16:03.020 --> 16:04.520
But I can't do it without asking...

16:04.520 --> 16:07.520
Tracksuit thieves!

16:07.850 --> 16:08.940
Captain.

16:09.120 --> 16:10.670
My heart just stopped!

16:12.140 --> 16:13.860
I see.

16:14.070 --> 16:18.170
I came here to get some dumbbells,
and you sure gave me a scare.

16:18.170 --> 16:21.120
Sorry... You scared us pretty good, too.

16:21.120 --> 16:24.830
Put on the muscle! Burn the fat!

16:21.320 --> 16:22.860
I understand the situation now.

16:22.860 --> 16:24.830
Hang on one second.

16:25.920 --> 16:28.670
Hello? You see...

16:30.300 --> 16:34.390
Um... Why's everyone from
the Body Improvement Club here?

16:34.390 --> 16:35.890
We're about to...

16:35.890 --> 16:37.760
The Body Improvement Club

16:37.760 --> 16:41.980
will now begin a three-day four-night
strengthening hell training camp!

16:44.040 --> 16:45.230
No, we're—

16:45.230 --> 16:47.480
We should always help
each other out when in need!

16:47.480 --> 16:49.440
I mean, we're really tired—

16:49.440 --> 16:51.820
I'm sure you want to sleep on a giant futon!

16:51.820 --> 16:53.280
No, a small one will do just fine!

16:53.280 --> 16:56.240
We have enough room for all
of you at my granny's house!

16:56.240 --> 16:59.530
You have to procure and make your own food,
so it'll be excellent training!

16:59.530 --> 17:01.950
And it's just a 90-minute jog away!
We'll be there in no time!

17:01.950 --> 17:03.040
Now, let's go!

17:03.040 --> 17:04.580
R-Reigen-san, help...

17:04.800 --> 17:07.540
Hey, that's great. Do your best.

17:07.750 --> 17:09.370
I'm gonna take a cab home.

17:10.950 --> 17:12.650
Body Improvement!

17:12.650 --> 17:15.700
Fight on! Fight on!

17:14.470 --> 17:15.700
How cruel...

17:17.070 --> 17:18.430
I totally forgot!

17:19.110 --> 17:21.980
I should've just gone over
to Reigen-san's place.

17:27.680 --> 17:30.020
I wonder what that thing is.

17:30.280 --> 17:33.700
It's even more confusing up close.

17:33.700 --> 17:37.090
How do one of these things even grow?

17:37.090 --> 17:39.450
Isn't it obvious?!

17:39.440 --> 17:42.600
Aliens! This is the work of aliens!

17:44.100 --> 17:45.020
Amazing.

17:45.020 --> 17:46.460
Could this be...

17:46.710 --> 17:48.960
The work of our beloved leader?

17:49.970 --> 17:52.880
Wow... It looks like a vegetable.

17:53.750 --> 17:56.090
I bet Mob-kun was involved.

17:56.300 --> 17:57.220
I just know it.

17:58.240 --> 17:59.600
That's amazing!

17:59.970 --> 18:02.140
You're the ones behind that giant plant?

18:02.470 --> 18:03.870
W-Well...

18:03.870 --> 18:07.770
If you're asking if we were
directly involved, then no.

18:07.770 --> 18:09.600
We basically were, though.

18:09.600 --> 18:10.150
What?

18:10.150 --> 18:12.480
Amazing! Fantastic!

18:12.480 --> 18:13.610
Mitsuura-san.

18:14.000 --> 18:17.490
I think I'm going to stop coming here.

18:17.780 --> 18:19.950
Kurosaki-san? But why?!

18:20.150 --> 18:22.960
If everything goes well with your research

18:22.960 --> 18:26.290
and you actually develop the technology
to make espers out of people,

18:26.570 --> 18:30.920
we might get more espers
who misuse their powers.

18:30.920 --> 18:33.740
So I think you should just stop.

18:33.740 --> 18:35.390
I don't even need the money.

18:36.540 --> 18:38.340
I agree.

18:38.340 --> 18:40.950
We're actually not that impressive.

18:42.190 --> 18:43.310
Kids...

18:45.070 --> 18:46.310
All right!

18:46.760 --> 18:49.520
I'll stop using you for research!

18:51.240 --> 18:54.260
But to be honest, I'm just having fun

18:54.890 --> 18:56.690
spending time with you kids.

18:57.330 --> 19:01.120
You don't mind coming by once
in a while as friends, do you?

19:02.180 --> 19:04.830
Hey. What are you going to do now?

19:05.070 --> 19:07.080
The organization is gone.

19:07.080 --> 19:09.470
I'm obviously going to have
to find another way to live.

19:09.950 --> 19:11.360
Yeah...

19:11.360 --> 19:15.810
Now that the scars on my face are gone,
maybe I'll start up a ramen shop.

19:15.810 --> 19:18.110
The hospitality industry is not for you.

19:18.110 --> 19:19.760
Just put your body to good use.

19:19.760 --> 19:21.850
What are you going to do, Sakurai?

19:21.850 --> 19:24.420
I have an interview at a convenience
store the day after tomorrow.

19:25.780 --> 19:27.510
What? You're going to ask him?

19:27.510 --> 19:31.190
Yes. I'm considering asking Master Reigen
if I can study under him for a while.

19:31.190 --> 19:34.440
Don't. You're really not a people person.

19:34.630 --> 19:37.400
I agree. You're kinda dreary.

19:40.570 --> 19:43.340
The government has determined that

19:43.340 --> 19:47.920
this is the work of
a delusional criminal organization, huh?

19:48.390 --> 19:51.530
I can't believe you turned yourself in
after being defeated by a civilian esper.

19:52.030 --> 19:53.040
It's the truth.

19:54.090 --> 19:57.500
Man, where does that leave us pros?

19:57.990 --> 19:59.470
What's going to happen to my dad?

20:01.090 --> 20:04.250
Under normal circumstances,
he'd be executed.

20:04.650 --> 20:08.480
But there is a chance he'll be kept alive
as a research subject.

20:09.050 --> 20:12.600
Why'd he have to say that to his son?

20:12.790 --> 20:15.290
Well, it's not my call to make,

20:15.290 --> 20:17.040
so I can't say for sure.

20:17.040 --> 20:18.610
P-P-President!

20:18.910 --> 20:20.140
Serizawa.

20:20.140 --> 20:24.320
I never actually considered
you all my comrades.

20:24.800 --> 20:26.420
There's no reason to be worried about me.

20:27.100 --> 20:31.020
Because you lack self-confidence,
others will find you easy to manipulate.

20:31.450 --> 20:32.980
Be careful from now on.

20:34.810 --> 20:35.460
Sho.

20:36.320 --> 20:40.590
I wanted you to see your mother again,

20:40.590 --> 20:44.000
but my pride severed that possibility.

20:44.380 --> 20:46.460
I'm truly sorry.

20:46.860 --> 20:47.470
Don't be.

20:47.920 --> 20:50.110
I see Mom every now and then.

20:51.070 --> 20:54.190
She's always asking me how you're doing.

20:54.400 --> 20:59.150
I wish I could've stopped you
before she found out what you'd become.

20:59.660 --> 21:02.690
When I called her this morning,
she said she'd come see you sometime.

21:03.550 --> 21:06.570
So don't you dare think this is all over.

21:06.880 --> 21:10.790
You still need to get an earful from Mom.

21:22.500 --> 21:26.680
"People need other people," huh?

21:27.680 --> 21:30.140
Spirits and Such Consultation Office

21:30.140 --> 21:33.100
What? It was just a short circuit?

21:33.340 --> 21:36.150
Apparently, a mouse bit into some wires.

21:36.150 --> 21:37.940
Thanks to that, the fire insurance kicked in,

21:37.940 --> 21:40.580
so we get a fresh start at a new office.

21:42.370 --> 21:45.240
But it sure looks bland right now.

21:46.290 --> 21:48.320
Mob, do your thing.

21:48.320 --> 21:49.200
Okay.

21:51.870 --> 21:53.190
Thanks.

21:55.910 --> 21:59.080
The hole in my uniform... I just remembered.

21:59.660 --> 22:03.110
I'd put the broccoli seeds in there.

22:04.220 --> 22:05.770
Broccoli?

22:05.770 --> 22:06.680
The seeds from back the—

22:09.850 --> 22:10.970
Now I see.

22:12.440 --> 22:14.060
Master, you mean that's...

22:15.070 --> 22:18.510
Welp. Let's just forget we ever saw this.

22:19.670 --> 22:21.910
But man, he sure is late...

22:23.860 --> 22:25.190
Oh, there you are.

22:25.560 --> 22:26.840
Come in.

22:26.840 --> 22:29.410
I got lost. I'm very sorry.

22:29.680 --> 22:31.930
Thanks for the other day, Kageyama-kun.

22:32.310 --> 22:33.910
A suit...?

22:34.230 --> 22:35.870
You're going to work here?

22:36.090 --> 22:39.830
Yup. Reigen-san made me
an offer after all that.

22:40.060 --> 22:43.050
He said that there was something
that even I could do.

22:43.300 --> 22:47.510
And it's the least I can do after
my organization caused everyone trouble.

22:50.950 --> 22:54.810
We're here to make a better tomorrow,
so this is perfect for you!

22:55.110 --> 22:57.270
Y-Yes, sir! I'll do my best!

22:57.530 --> 23:01.250
My client will be here soon,
but before that...

23:01.250 --> 23:01.980
Huh?

23:02.530 --> 23:04.580
We're going to have to
do something about that.

23:05.310 --> 23:05.990
Huh?

23:07.270 --> 23:09.740
Whoa, that's amazing.

23:11.130 --> 23:12.450
He looks so different.

23:12.680 --> 23:16.190
I guess he at least looks like
he can pull off customer service now.

23:16.190 --> 23:20.670
C-Customer service?! Wh-What should
I do when a customer shows up?!

23:20.930 --> 23:22.320
What did you do at your last job?

23:22.640 --> 23:26.840
My orders were to smack them with
my umbrella if I sensed any hostility...

23:26.990 --> 23:28.210
The hell?

23:28.210 --> 23:30.540
Yeah, things aren't that different here.

23:30.540 --> 23:32.290
If there's anything else
you don't understand,

23:32.290 --> 23:33.800
go ahead and ask your senior there.

23:33.800 --> 23:35.060
Senior?

23:35.060 --> 23:39.370
Mob, you show him the ropes
while he's still in training.

23:39.370 --> 23:39.990
Huh?

23:41.270 --> 23:44.230
It's a pleasure to work with you,
Kageyama-senpai!

23:44.470 --> 23:48.250
Huh? It's... a pleasure
to work with you, too...

23:49.120 --> 23:53.200
What should I do?
Now I'm getting nervous, too.

23:53.200 --> 23:58.200
Spirits and Such Consultation Office

23:53.790 --> 23:55.550
Pardon me.

23:55.550 --> 23:58.200
Oh, hello there! Sorry about the mess.

23:58.560 --> 24:00.260
Please have a seat right over there.

24:00.260 --> 24:02.010
Serizawa, get our guest some tea.

24:02.010 --> 24:06.220
T-Tea? I-I'm sorry,
I've never made tea before...

24:06.220 --> 24:07.470
We're doomed.
